      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW QUANTUM (7) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (24.90) in a Grade 5 at Sale. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Has ability and looks hard to stop. FIELD OF ANGELS (8) had been racing well with a Grade 4/5 win three back then placed next time before missing the frame latest at this track. Well placed here and can atone this time. PAW DANGER (6) doesn't win out of turn. Finished third (22.30) at Ballarat latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Has performed well from this box with a win and six minor placings to his name from nine starts. Hard to beat again. DOONGALLA ADAM (2) placed last time out so worth considering.",
